// Title: Linux Remote System Discovery
// Rule ID: 11063ec2-de63-4153-935e-b1a8b9e616f1
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1018
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
